      "index": "av",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1357040301,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1933610979,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772022864415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "next\n\nFires when Observable\nreturns data successfully.\nReceives the response\nas a parameter.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "next_b",
      "originalText": "next\n\nFires when Observable\nreturns data successfully.\nReceives the response\nas a parameter.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IoWtdTh8pzx4EEAMlBNem",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 351.0893325805664,
      "y": 688.75,
      "width": 191.8213348388672,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ef4444",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1492053261,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1253774285,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772022864415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "error\n\nFires when something\ngoes wrong fetching data.\nReplaces try/catch\nfrom old fetch code.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "error_b",
      "originalText": "error\n\nFires when something\ngoes wrong fetching data.\nReplaces try/catch\nfrom old fetch code.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ruJpRiXAnaZ8ndQgNIgUZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 618.2542343139648,
      "y": 688.75,
      "width": 215.4915313720703,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d97706",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ax",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 604488557,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 554343299,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772022864415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "complete\n\nFires ONCE after next.\nNever fires after error.\nUse it for logic\nyou want AFTER data loads.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "complete_b",
      "originalText": "complete\n\nFires ONCE after next.\nNever fires after error.\nUse it for logic\nyou want AFTER data loads.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e3QsPYMYnsCUNkHNcymeL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56.06146240234375,
      "y": 948.25,
      "width": 292.8770751953125,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2563eb",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ay",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 376884685,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1059131949,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772022864415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Why is HttpClient better than fetch?\n\nReturns Observable not Promise.\nSupports interceptors.\nCancellable requests.\nNative Angular change detection.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq1",
      "originalText": "Q: Why is HttpClient better than fetch?\n\nReturns Observable not Promise.\nSupports interceptors.\nCancellable requests.\nNative Angular change detection.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9kmzbnq5_MPlyeGncmyIP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 442.53155517578125,
      "y": 948.25,
      "width": 265.9368896484375,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "az",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 599415075,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 215102243,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772022864415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Why not subscribe in the Service?\n\nComponent owns the lifecycle.\nService returns raw Observable.\nSubscribing in Service = data\ntrapped there, can't share it.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq2",
      "originalText": "Q: Why not subscribe in the Service?\n\nComponent owns the lifecycle.\nService returns raw Observable.\nSubscribing in Service = data\ntrapped there, can't share it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CVcTBv7y1UlO86MmrzyaJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 795.0039215087891,
      "y": 953.625,
      "width": 306.9921569824219,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#16a34a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1524114669,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 116933773,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772022864415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Difference between next and complete?\n\nnext: fires for each value emitted.\ncomplete: fires once after Observable\nfinishes. Never fires if error occurs.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq3",
      "originalText": "Q: Difference between next and complete?\n\nnext: fires for each value emitted.\ncomplete: fires once after Observable\nfinishes. Never fires if error occurs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1Y-zd8SZM842cEHQ73ksq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60.066497802734375,
      "y": 1088.625,
      "width": 284.86700439453125,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d97706",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b01",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 666828621,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 923129539,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772022864415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Why provideHttpClient in app.config?\n\nHttpClient is NOT providedIn: root.\nYou must register it explicitly.\napp.config = shared project config.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq4",
      "originalText": "Q: Why provideHttpClient in app.config?\n\nHttpClient is NOT providedIn: root.\nYou must register it explicitly.\napp.config = shared project config.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IuLI9htS0CHYxWq-Q7pum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 435.5865173339844,
      "y": 1083.25,
      "width": 279.82696533203125,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0d9488",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b02",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1000050093,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 100281069,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772022864415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: What does withFetch() do?\n\nMakes HttpClient use fetch API\ninternally instead of XMLHttpRequest.\nBetter performance + better\nbrowser compatibility.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq5",
      "originalText": "Q: What does withFetch() do?\n\nMakes HttpClient use fetch API\ninternally instead of XMLHttpRequest.\nBetter performance + better\nbrowser compatibility.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GhXKuHiSPAeQH6P8TbKdo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 823.489143371582,
      "y": 1083.25,
      "width": 250.02171325683594,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 776946499,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 239339107,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772022864415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Why put API logic in a Service?\n\nShared across Components.\nSingle responsibility.\nEasier to test and maintain.\nNot required but always preferred.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq6",
      "originalText": "Q: Why put API logic in a Service?\n\nShared across Components.\nSingle responsibility.\nEasier to test and maintain.\nNot required but always preferred.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
